AI Assessment – Description

AI (Artificial Intelligence) Assessment is a test designed to evaluate a student's knowledge, skills, and understanding of Artificial Intelligence. It may include questions on AI basics, machine learning, logical reasoning, coding, and problem-solving skills.

Short description:

Tests knowledge of Artificial Intelligence.

Evaluates logical thinking and problem-solving.

Assesses basic programming skills.

Helps improve AI and technical knowledge.

Prepares students for future AI-related careers.


